---
title: "depositFlow (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_approve: approve USDC transfer to contract
    q_approve --> q_approve_fail: approval tx reverts
    q_approve_fail --> [*]: deposit aborted
    q_approve --> q_approved: approval tx succeeds
    q_approved --> q_deposit: execute deposit with signature
    q_deposit --> q_deposit_fail: deposit tx reverts
    q_deposit_fail --> [*]: deposit failed
    q_deposit --> q_confirmed: deposit tx succeeds
    q_confirmed --> q_webhook: trigger webhook notification
    q_webhook --> [*]: deposit complete, webhook sent

    note right of q_approve
        INV-001: USDC approval must precede deposit execution
        INV-002: deposit signature must be obtained from step 6 endpoint
        INV-003: webhook fires only on successful deposit
    end note

    note right of q_deposit
        INV-004: deposit amount must match approved USDC amount
        INV-005: signature must not be replayable after use
    end note
